I want a haircut.
I sometimes go to the nearby salon.
Today I call them.
A woman answers the phone.
She says, "Hello, Star Salon."
I say, "Hello, I want an appointment for a haircut."
She says, "Sure madam."
"On which day do you want an appointment?"
I say, "I want time this Saturday."
I ask further, "What time is available on Saturday?"
She checks and says, "There is time at ten o'clock and eleven o'clock in the morning."
I always wake up late on Saturday mornings.
Therefore, ten o'clock in the morning does not suit me.
I say, "Give me the appointment for eleven o'clock in the morning."
The woman says, "That works, madam."
"What is your name?"
I reply, "My name is Maya."
She says, "Thank you, Maya madam."
"Your appointment is on Saturday at exactly eleven o'clock."
I thank her and hang up the phone.
My Saturday morning is now set.
